Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "UnusualAnimalCrossingInFog" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1, :actor2, :actor3 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 .

:actor1 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "White bear-like animal crossing road" .
:actor2 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "Goat-like animal crossing road" .
:actor3 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "Small animal crossing road" .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Animals obstructing roadway" .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition ;
    :description "Heavy fog reducing visibility" .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Animals crossing into vehicle path" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Fog obscuring visibility of animals" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Slippery road conditions due to rain/fog" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.88"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: Animals crossing into vehicle path
Severity Score: 0.95

